 {
  id="pal-prot-wowhead-tips",
  spec="Protection",
  label="Protection · Wowhead levelling priorities (official)",
  kind="priorities",
  default=false,
  note="Priorities only: the exact build sits in an embedded calculator that cannot be read as text. Highlights mark the talents the guide discusses; there is no point order to follow.",
  priorities="Official Wowhead guide. Main objective: Pursuit of Justice 2/2 as early as possible (stated 2/2 at level 21, i.e. Ret first). Early Ret: Deflection or Benediction (Benediction if skipping Sanctified Judgement); Sanctified Judgement is very mana-efficient while leveling; Holy Conduit strong if Consecration used rotationally. Single-target mana comparison relative to Improved Seal of Fury=100%: Shield Specialization 54.5%, Holy Conduit 103.7%, Sanctified Judgement 64.9%. Taking the Ret mana talents delays Holy Shield by 3 levels; optional respec at 40 for Holy Shield. Companion Wowhead 'Level 20 Protection Paladin' page (Riyani, 2026-09-29) likewise favours Ret (Holy Conduit, Benediction, 1 Pursuit of Justice) at 20, extra Legacy points into Sanctified Judgement 3/3 (not 1-2), or PoJ 2nd point + Vindication / Redoubt. The exact build is in an embedded talent calculator that could not be read as text.",
