 {
  id="pal-holy-dungeon",
  spec="Holy",
  label="Holy · Dungeon healer 31/7/13 (10–60)",
  kind="exact-order",
  default=false,
  note="Exact point order. User-submitted Wowhead guide (Drakanthos), dungeon/small-group variant.",
  priorities="Same Holy path as the raid build (Holy to Light's Vigil at 40), then Ret mana: Benediction 5, Holy Conduit 2, Improved Judgement 2, Conviction 1, Sanctified Judgement 3 (levels 51-53, replacing Pursuit of Justice), then Toughness 5 (54-58) and Guardian's Favor 2 (59-60). Drops Pursuit of Justice and the Anticipation point: in 5-player groups there is time to Judge between pulls, so mana refund beats run speed. Variant attributed to Classic WoW Forever and LePreStore.",
  source={
